
{"id":38,"date":"2025-06-02T08:00:35","date_gmt":"2025-06-02T08:00:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/probus.io\/?page_id=38"},"modified":"2025-06-02T08:00:35","modified_gmt":"2025-06-02T08:00:35","slug":"privacy-policy","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/probus.io\/privacy-policy\/","title":{"rendered":"Privacy Policy"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>1. Introduction<\/h2>\n<p>Welcome to Probus Smart Things. As part of our commitment to your privacy, we have established this Privacy Policy. We value the trust you place in us and respect your privacy in handling personal identification information relating to you and your use of our website, probus.io, and our services. This Privacy Policy applies to all of the products, services, and websites offered by Probus Smart Things Pvt. Ltd.<\/p>\n<h2>2. Information We Collect<\/h2>\n<p>We may collect the following types of information:<\/p>\n<p>Information you provide \u2013 When you sign up for a Probus Smart Things account, we may ask you for personal information such as your name, email address, billing address, and product preferences. Log information \u2013 When you access Probus Smart Things services, our servers automatically record information that your browser sends whenever you visit a website. User communications \u2013 When you send emails or other communications to Probus Smart Things, we may retain those communications to process your inquiries, respond to your requests, and improve our services.<\/p>\n<h2>3. How We Use Your Information<\/h2>\n<p>To provide products and services to you.<br \/>\nTo personalize your experience with us.<br \/>\nTo improve customer service.<br \/>\nTo process transactions.<br \/>\nTo administer a contest, promotion, or survey.<br \/>\nTo send periodic emails related to your order or other products and services.<\/p>\n<h2>4. Sharing of Your Information<\/h2>\n<p>We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personally identifiable information to outside parties. This does not include trusted third parties who assist us in operating our website, conducting our business, or servicing you, so long as those parties agree to keep this information confidential.<\/p>\n<h2>5. Your Consent<\/h2>\n<p>By using our site and services, you consent to our Privacy Policy.<\/p>\n<h2>6. Changes to Our Privacy Policy<\/h2>\n<p>Probus Smart Things reserves the right to update this privacy policy at any time. We will notify you about significant changes in the way we treat personal information by sending a notice to the primary email address specified in your Probus Smart Things account or by placing a prominent notice on our site.<\/p>\n<h2>7. Contacting Us<\/h2>\n<p>If there are any questions regarding this privacy policy, you may contact us using the information below.<\/p>\n<p>Probus Smart Things Pvt. Ltd.<br \/>\n63, 3rd floor, DSIDC Complex, Okhla Phase -1, New Delhi- 110020<br \/>\ninfo@probus.io<br \/>\n011 4103 3012<\/p>\n<h2>8. Grievance Officer<\/h2>\n<p>In accordance with Information Technology Act 2000 and rules made there under, the name and contact details of the Grievance Officer are provided below:<\/p>\n<p>Probus Smart Things Pvt. Ltd.<br \/>\n4th Floor, No. 15A, Tradex Tower, Noida Sector-125, Uttar Pradesh, INDIA<br \/>\ninfo@probus.io<br \/>\n011 4103 3012<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>1. Introduction Welcome to Probus Smart Things. As part of our commitment to your privacy, we have established this Privacy Policy. We value the trust you place in us and respect your privacy in handling personal identification information relating to you and your use of our website, probus.io, and our services. This Privacy Policy applies [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"default.php","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-38","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This si